# Marker meshes use the shared material, placement and scene submission APIs.
import scene_route.dl

class:
    patterns:
        website Farm markers
    members:
        landscape as a pointer to website Farm landscape
        selection as a pointer to UI scene object
        destination as a pointer to UI scene object
        route as a pointer to website Farm route scenery
        navigation as website Farm navigation display

to get [a website Farm marker using] {UI scene mesh:mesh} [colored] {UI paint:color} [named] {C string:name} [in] {a pointer to website Farm landscape:landscape}:
    set material to a UI scene material with color color roughness 1.0 metalness 0.0
    set material's unlit and material's double sided to true
    set model to a website Farm scene model using mesh colored material casting shadow false
    set object to a website Farm object named name using model in landscape
    set object's pickable and object's visible to false
    return object

to get [website Farm markers in] {a pointer to website Farm landscape:landscape}:
    set result to storage for one slot initialized with (a new website Farm markers)
    set result's landscape to landscape
    set result's route to website Farm route scenery in landscape
    set result's selection to a website Farm marker using (a UI ring mesh with inner 0.34 outer 0.42 around 32 sides) colored (UI ink 255 228 160) named "selected-person" in landscape
    set result's destination to a website Farm marker using (a UI ring mesh with inner 0.32 outer 0.40 around 32 sides) colored (UI ink 255 240 161) named "route-destination" in landscape
    return result

to get [place website Farm marker] {a pointer to UI scene object:object} [at] {UI scene vector:position} [visible] {boolean:visible}:
    set changed to object's visible != visible
    set object's visible to visible
    if visible:
        set pose to an identity UI scene pose
        set pose's position to position
        set pose's rotation's x to -1.5707963267948966
        if (pose is the same UI scene pose as object's instance's root pose) = false:
            set UI scene root pose in (object's instance) to pose
            set changed to true
    return changed

to get [refresh website Farm markers] {a pointer to website Farm markers:markers} [using] {a pointer to website Farm characters:characters} [dragging] {string:dragged}:
    set data to markers's navigation
    set position to a UI scene vector from [0.0,0.0,0.0]
    set selected to data's person is not empty
    if selected:
        set character to the website Farm character named (data's person) in characters
        require condition (character != (0 as a pointer to website Farm character)) reporting "The selected Farm person has no scene character"
        set position to character's motion's position
        if character's id = dragged:
            set position to character's object's instance's root pose's position
    set changed to place website Farm marker (markers's selection) at (position + (a UI scene vector from [0.0,0.018,0.0])) visible selected
    set destination to place website Farm marker (markers's destination) at (data's destination) visible (data's destination present)
    set route to refresh website Farm route (markers's route) through data from (position + (a UI scene vector from [0.0,0.07,0.0]))
    return changed or (destination or route)

to [close website Farm markers] {a pointer to website Farm markers:markers}:
    close website Farm route (markers's route)
    remove website Farm scene object (markers's selection) from (markers's landscape)
    remove website Farm scene object (markers's destination) from (markers's landscape)
    destroy the value at markers
    deallocate markers
